    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C76E71C6C3591663",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要挑戰深情靈魂饒舌樂……\\n道館館主萊姆嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C76E72C6C3591816",
      "text": "那麼，請讓我帶[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳前往對戰場。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C76E73C6C35919C9",
      "text": "等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好後，\\n請隨時告訴我一聲。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_nobattle",
      "hash64": "D0A496BAB24C009D",
      "text": "想挑戰萊姆的話，\\n至少要有２隻能對戰的寶可夢喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_00",
      "hash64": "F4F1D404F7C6E265",
      "text": "YO YO……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CDB670A9B4004749",
      "text": "……從對戰場的方向\\n傳來了帶有節奏感的對話！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_01",
      "hash64": "F4F1D304F7C6E0B2",
      "text": "今天的饒舌對戰，就要妳吞下敗仗♪\\nYO我的朋友！輸了就要腳底抹油♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_02",
      "hash64": "F4F1D204F7C6DEFF",
      "text": "聽我的RAP，道館館主♪\\n我是個TOP，打工不苦♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_02",
      "hash64": "CDB66DA9B4004230",
      "text": "咚咚隆咚鏘鏘……\\n咚咚隆咚鏘……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "1436B0F9B1C26717",
      "text": "打工不痛苦？♪\\nRHYME卻馬馬虎虎♪\\r\\n敗者乖乖收拾包袱回家哭哭♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "1436B1F9B1C268CA",
      "text": "我是萊姆♪不是什麼聖母♪\\n你說我酷？莫怪我像個炸藥庫♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "1436B2F9B1C26A7D",
      "text": "菜鳥超遜，快從白日夢裡清醒♪\\n善哉善哉！靠饒舌救你一命♪HEY！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_03",
      "hash64": "CDB66EA9B40043E3",
      "text": "咚咚隆咚鏘鏘……\\n咚咚隆咚鏘……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_03",
      "hash64": "F4F1D104F7C6DD4C",
      "text": "完敗、慘敗，說BYE-BYE！\\n雪恥，不遲，滴水穿石～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "1436ABF9B1C25E98",
      "text": "站住！節奏還沒停啊！\\c\\n唉……什麼滴水穿石！\\n你這麼隨性使勁，真是掃了我的興！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "1436ACF9B1C2604B",
      "text": "一秒放棄，真是洩氣！\\n有志氣的對手究竟跑到哪去！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "1436ADF9B1C261FE",
      "text": "……嗯？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "1436AEF9B1C263B1",
      "text": "下一個對手是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嗎？開場的寶貝。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要道館對戰，還是要饒舌對戰？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0E65523F48A7AD8E",
      "text": "道館對戰！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0E65513F48A7ABDB",
      "text": "饒舌對戰！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "1436A7F9B1C257CC",
      "text": "當然不是饒舌，\\n不然我會欺人太甚！HAHAHA！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "1436A8F9B1C2597F",
      "text": "HAHA！[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這回答，\\n真是玩笑開得我眉開眼笑！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "143A35F9B1C57EED",
      "text": "……嗯？[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳覺得我說話的方式\\n聽起來很不可思議？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "143A34F9B1C57D3A",
      "text": "這叫做饒舌！\\c\\n乘著節奏唱出押韻的字詞，\\n交織出一種充滿靈魂的歌詞。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "143A33F9B1C57B87",
      "text": "勾魂眼，好倒楣，出門立刻遇打雷♪\\n閃亮亮，開了胃，只好明天再減肥♪\\r\\n……大概就是這樣！感覺到了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "143A32F9B1C579D4",
      "text": "哎，不過[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是個寶可夢訓練家！\\n就用對戰秀出[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳那股激昂的勁兒吧！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "143A31F9B1C57821",
      "text": "雖然我的本行是個饒舌歌手，\\n不過讓我用起幽靈寶可夢，\\r\\n是幾乎沒人能贏過我的喔。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "143A30F9B1C5766E",
      "text": "我是萊姆！\\n人、稱、我，深情靈魂饒舌樂！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_16",
      "hash64": "143A2FF9B1C574BB",
      "text": "讓我們使出勁來共鳴！\\nSOUL！LIFE！對戰就是要FEEL！！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_17",
      "hash64": "143A2EF9B1C57308",
      "text": "HAHAHA！好啊！\\n我感受到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳帶勁的靈魂啦！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_18",
      "hash64": "143A2DF9B1C57155",
      "text": "竟然能讓我嘆出一口氣，真是有骨氣！\\n哼！這道館徽章[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就拿去吧！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_19",
      "hash64": "143A2CF9B1C56FA2",
      "text": "要不要順便收下能在\\n演唱會貴賓席聽我唱歌的權利呀？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
